[8.823086, "o", "held\r\n  JSON array of 32-character lowercase hex strings. Each held id is the sha256 digest of the slip, truncated to 16 bytes, lowercase hex. Print that digest with sha256sum - and take the first 32 hex characters.\r\n\r\nnote\r\n  ok\r\n  gap\r\n\r\nkind\r\n  live\r\n  void\r\n\r\nA pin row is 48 bytes starting with ASCII PN01. Bytes after the magic are offset, length, checksum, then a 16-byte id.\r\n"]
